; Resources and structure (doc/manual/resources-and-structure.md):
; bracket scopes a resource to one test, scoped takes a callback-shaped
; one whole, fixture shares one across the run and the runner releases
; it at the end; temp_dir, setenv and chdir are put back by the runner;
; subtest labels sub-cases, a group's ~timeout and ~retries are its
; tests' defaults, and xfail keeps a known bug in-tree.

